WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.261
Kip looked closely at his new friend.

2
00:00:14.262 --> 00:00:19.628
"You're right, Bird," he said.

3
00:00:19.629 --> 00:00:24.531
"This is a fake person.

4
00:00:24.532 --> 00:00:27.466
But she's still my friend."

5
00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:42.481
"No, she's our friend!" Bird said.

6
00:00:42.482 --> 00:01:00.305
Just then they heard a voice.

7
00:01:00.306 --> 00:01:04.748
"I lost Ashley!" cried a girl.

8
00:01:04.749 --> 00:01:07.394
"Don't worry," said her mom.

9
00:01:07.395 --> 00:01:09.660
"We'll find Ashley."

10
00:01:09.661 --> 00:01:14.202
"I wonder who Ashley is," said Bird.

11
00:01:14.203 --> 00:01:18.150
"It's sad that Ashley is lost," said Kip.

12
00:01:18.151 --> 00:01:21.240
"It sure is," said Bird.

13
00:01:21.241 --> 00:01:25.016
"I hope they find—"

14
00:01:25.017 --> 00:01:28.218
"Ashley!" cried the girl.

15
00:01:28.219 --> 00:01:33.309
The girl came running over.

16
00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:40.607
"She's going to take our friend!" cried Kip.

17
00:01:40.608 --> 00:01:45.215
"Kip, wait!" said Bird.

18
00:01:45.216 --> 00:01:56.892
"I found Ashley, Mom!" called the girl.

19
00:01:56.893 --> 00:02:05.408
"The fake person is Ashley!" said Bird.

20
00:02:05.409 --> 00:02:08.554
"Oh well," said Kip.

21
00:02:08.555 --> 00:02:16.730
"It's sad that we lost our fake friend."

22
00:02:16.731 --> 00:02:27.440
"I like real friends better anyway," said Bird.

23
00:02:27.441 --> 00:02:29.902
"Me too," said Kip.

24
00:02:29.903 --> 00:02:39.013
"Let's play hide-and-seek!"

